      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The δ lamellae and γ″ precipitates are nanoscale or fine.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A conventional refractory HEA typically has a single-phase, coarse, or otherwise non-optimized microstructure.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventional refractory HEAs typically exhibit a strength–ductility trade-off.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled heat treatments can generate the proposed SCCPs lamellar structure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical alloying followed by thermal processing can generate the proposed SCCPs lamellar structure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant deformation behavior can be examined by tensile testing at room temperature.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The structural mediator is a coherent lamellar microstructure in which δ lamellae coexist with γ″ precipitates.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "During deformation, dislocations cut through the δ lamellae.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "During deformation, γ″ particles pin dislocations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coherent δ/γ boundaries promote early-stage planar dislocation slip.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::003::discussion::98e65aafcb"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Early-stage planar slip improves strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
